# beard/full: Full beard: the cheeks, the jaw and a pointed chin in the hair ramp, the mouth showing
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to HAIR in wave 2). On the head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
